  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Iconic silhouette made for Ken Griffey Jr. in 1996\nSynthetic leather and nubuck overlays for a layered, premium look\nLace closure with heel and ankle loops for easy on and off\nAdjustable hook-and-loop ankle strap sports Griffey's jersey number\nSculpted, wavy midsole lends authentic retro style\nVisible Max Air units in the forefoot and heel deliver high-impact cushioning\nDurable rubber outsole with a high-traction pattern for everyday wear\nThe Nike Air Griffey Max 1 is imported.\n\n\nInspired by the inimitable style of \"The Kid,\" the Men's Nike Air Griffey Max 1 returns to the lineup. Originally released when Griffey Jr. dominated the diamond with spectacular web gems and his signature swing, this silhouette remains a definitive head-turner. Its bold design and visible Air units defined an era of footwear and continue to anchor the rotation of collectors and sneakerheads alike.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Griffey Max 1 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Black/Fresh Water/Varsity Red</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3478418</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12p